notes.notes:
We finally finished developing the final patch. Now the game looks exactly as we intended it. If you played this game in the early days, and it seemed unfinished to you, then we advise you to give it one more chance to please you.

[b]Patch Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*] Fixed crash of voice acting when changing volume;
[*] The mechanics of defecation has been altered - now the characters can notice you from afar;
[*] Optimized complexity;
[*] Changed the interface to a more intuitive;
[*] Fixed skillcheck;
[*] Minor cosmetic changes.
[/list]
